## User

A list holding x, n times.

## Type

type
```bend
def rep(n: Nat, +x: Nat) -> List<&2, Nat>:
```

## Term

```bend
match n:
  case 0n:
    [x]
  case 1n+p:
    x <> rep(p, x)
```

